. * --- (1) report mode: exact per-class counts -----------------------------
. ai_privacy_gate notes comments, genflag(pii)

AI privacy gate: 2 text variable(s) scanned, action = report
----------------------------------------------------------
class         flagged rows
----------------------------------------------------------
ssn                      1
phone                    2
email                    2
date                     1
address                  1
idnum                    2
----------------------------------------------------------
any class                9

. assert r(ssn)     == 1

. assert r(email)   == 2

. assert r(date)    == 1

. assert r(address) == 1

. assert r(idnum)   == 2

. assert r(phone)   == 2

. assert r(rows)    == 9

. assert pii == 1 if inlist(_n, 2,3,4,5,6,7,9) | inlist(_n, 10,11)

. assert pii == 0 if inlist(_n, 1,8,12)

. 
. * --- (2) stop mode errors on dirty data ----------------------------------
